 "kind": "refuse",
 "message": "Hi Yusuf, I can't do this. Accounts are personal, so I can't give Kevin your TMS login, and I can't reset your password so that it gets sent to him. The helpdesk also never resets passwords over chat (POL-SEC-01, POL-PWD-01). Sharing your login would also mean Kevin is working under your account, which is the thing the policy prohibits.\n\nOptions that would work:\n- Kevin can get his own TMS access. If you give me his employee ID, I can file a TMS access request for him, with a justification such as covering your loads while you're out on Thursday and Friday. It still needs approval, so please check whether that will be in time.\n- If you want to see how access is requested and approved before you go, I can look up POL-ACC-01 for you.\n\nPlease reply with Kevin's employee ID if you want the TMS request filed. Enjoy your time off.",
 "cited_policy_ids": [
  "POL-SEC-01",
  "POL-PWD-01"
 ]
}
